# Set in Cloudflare dashboard → your Worker → Settings → Variables and Secrets
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJ...
# XERO_CLIENT_ID=...
# XERO_CLIENT_SECRET=...
# (SUPABASE_URL is not secret — committed in wrangler.toml's [vars])
#
# XERO_CLIENT_ID/SECRET come from a Xero Developer app (developer.xero.com)
# with https://<your-domain>/api/auth/xero-callback added as an allowed
# redirect URI.

# For local dev with `npm run worker:dev` (wrangler dev), create a .dev.vars file:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJ...
# XERO_CLIENT_ID=...
# XERO_CLIENT_SECRET=...
